nce for the future. Through my readings, I help individuals understand their life purpose, relationships, and recurring patterns, empowering them to make conscious and aligned decisions.",p2:"As a Lama Fera healer, I channel powerful, high-frequency energies rooted in ancient Buddhist traditions. My healing work focuses on deep spiritual cleansing, removing negative karmic imprints, and accelerating personal and spiritual growth. This process creates space for positivity, peace, and higher awareness to flow into one's life.",p3:"In addition, I am a skilled Pranic Healer who works with the body's energy field to remove blockages and restore balance—without physical touch. By cleansing and energizing the aura, I support faster physical, emotional, and mental healing, helping individuals regain strength and inner stability.",p4:"Through the integration of Akashic Reading, Lama Fera, and Pranic Healing, I offer a holistic approach to well-being. My work harmonizes the mind, body, and soul, allowing energy to flow freely and naturally. I believe that true healing begins within, and my mission is to guide individuals toward self-awareness, inner peace, and a higher state of consciousness.",tags:["Soul-Guided Practice","Ethically Trained","Globally Trusted","Results-Focused"],certifiedTitle:"Rekha Bala",certifiedSubtitle:"Certified Akaashic Reader",certifiedGuild:"International Akaashic Guild",certifiedDesc:"Trained under globally recognized Akashic masters with years of dedicated practice.",founderQuote:`"The records hold no judgment — only infinite compassion and wisdom for your soul's highest good."`,founderDesc:"With thousands of sessions conducted globally, Rekha Bala brings a rare combination of deep spiritual training, intuitive clarity, and grounded, practical guidance. Every reading and teaching comes from a place of genuine service to the soul's evolution.",founderExtra1:"I am an intuitive Akashic Reader, Lama Fera healer, and Pranic Healer dedicated to guiding individuals toward clarity, balance, and inner transformation. My work is centered on understanding the deeper layers of the soul and energy body, helping people navigate life with awareness, purpose, and confidence.",founderExtra2:"Through Akashic Reading, I access the soul's records to uncover insights about past influences, present challenges, and future possibilities. As a Lama Fera healer, I channel high-frequency energies to support deep spiritual cleansing and growth. Alongside this, my Pranic Healing practice focuses on clearing and energizing the body's energy field, promoting holistic healing without physical touch.",founderExtra3:"By integrating these powerful modalities, I offer a balanced approach that nurtures the mind, body, and soul. My intention is to help individuals release blockages, align with their true path, and experience a deeper sense of peace, healing, and self-discovery.",valuesTitle:"Our Core Values",values:[{title:"Compassion",description:"Every reading and session is held with deep love and non-judgment, honouring each soul's unique journey."},{title:"Clarity",description:"We deliver clear, actionable insights that illuminate your path and empower you to make aligned decisions."},{title:"Growth",description:"Our courses and sessions are designed to catalyze lasting transformation and continuous spiritual evolution."},{title:"Community",description:"You're never alone on this journey. Our vibrant community of seekers supports each other with heart and wisdom."}]},courses:{tagline:"Transform Your Practice",heading:"Sacred",headingItalic:"Courses",headingSuffix:"& Programs",desc:"From beginner foundations to advanced mastery — our courses guide you step by step into the transformative world of Akaashic reading and soul healing.",mostPopular:"Most Popular",enrollNow:"Enroll Now",notSureHeading:"Not Sure Which Course Is Right for You?",notSureDesc:"Book a free 15-minute discovery call with our team and we'll help you choose the perfect path for your spiritual journey.",freeCTA:"Schedule a Free Discovery Call",levels:{Beginner:"Beginner",Intermediate:"Intermediate",Advanced:"Advanced","All Levels":"All Levels"},coursesData:[{id:"1",title:"Akaashic Foundation Course",description:"Begin your sacred journey into the Akaashic Records. Learn foundational concepts, opening meditations, and basic channeling techniques to access cosmic wisdom.",level:"Beginner",category:"Foundation",duration:"4 Weeks",features:["8 Live Sessions","Study Workbook","Guided Meditations","Certificate","Community Access","Lifetime Recordings"]},{id:"2",title:"Intermediate Reading Mastery",description:"Deepen your reading practice with advanced techniques for soul contract exploration, karmic patterns, and multidimensional channeling for self and others.",level:"Intermediate",category:"Mastery",duration:"6 Weeks",features:["12 Live Sessions","Practice Partner Sessions","Case Studies","Certificate","Group Mentorship","Resource Library"]},{id:"3",title:"Advanced Soul Mapping",description:"Master the art of comprehensive soul blueprint readings, life purpose mapping, and accessing the higher councils of the Akaashic dimension.",level:"Advanced",category:"Advanced",duration:"8 Weeks",features:["16 Live Sessions","1:1 Mentorship Calls","Client Practice","Advanced Certificate","Priority Support","Business Module"]},{id:"4",title:"Healing & Energy Clearance",description:"Learn powerful Akaashic-based healing techniques to clear karmic imprints, release energy blocks, and restore soul alignment for yourself and your clients.",level:"All Levels",category:"Healing",duration:"3 Weeks",features:["6 Live Sessions","Healing Scripts","Clearance Protocols","Certificate","Practice Community","Monthly Support Call"]},{id:"5",title:"Past Life Regression",description:"Explore your soul's journey across lifetimes. Understand recurring patterns, discover hidden talents, and heal ancestral wounds through guided regression.",level:"Intermediate",category:"Regression",duration:"5 Weeks",features:["10 Live Sessions","Personal Regression","Case Studies","Certificate","Peer Group Sessions","Integration Coaching"]},{id:"6",title:"Akaashic Channel Opening",description:"A gentle, supportive program designed to safely open your Akaashic channel through breath work, sacred prayers, and consciousness expansion practices.",level:"Beginner",category:"Awakening",duration:"2 Weeks",features:["4 Live Sessions","Opening Prayer Booklet","Daily Practices","Certificate","Beginner Community","Email Support"]}]},consultancy:{tagline:"Personal Guidance Awaits",headingPre:"Book a",headingHighlight:"Reading",desc:"Schedule your personalized Akaashic session and take the first step toward profound clarity and soul-aligned living.",whatToExpect:"What to Expect",sessionDesc:"Your session is a sacred space created just for you. Through the Akashic Records, we'll explore your soul's deepest wisdom and provide the clarity you've been seeking.",ourServices:"Our Services",servicesList:["Personal Akaashic Reading","Soul Blueprint Session","Past Life Regression","Energy Clearance","Career Guidance","Relationship Reading"],benefits:["Personalized 60–70 min sessions","Completely safe & confidential","Immediate clarity & actionable insights","Flexible scheduling across time zones"],formTitle:"Request Your Session",labelFullName:"Full Name *",labelEmail:"Email Address *",labelPhone:"Phone / WhatsApp",labelService:"Service Needed *",labelDate:"Preferred Date",labelTime:"Preferred Time",labelMessage:"Your Message / Intention",placeholderFullName:"Your full name",placeholderEmail:"your@email.com",placeholderMessage:"Share what you'd like to explore or any specific questions you have for your reading...",selectService:"Select a service",selectTime:"Select time slot",submitBtn:"Request a Session",submitting:"Sending Request...",confidentialNote:"We'll respond within 24 hours. Your information is kept strictly confidential.",successTitle:"Booking Request Sent!",successDesc:"Thank you! We'll confirm your session within 24 hours via email. Your soul's journey awaits. ✨",services:[{id:"personal-reading",label:"Personal Akaashic Reading"},{id:"soul-blueprint",label:"Soul Blueprint Session"},{id:"past-life",label:"Past Life Regression"},{id:"energy-clearance",label:"Energy Clearance & Healing"},{id:"career-guidance",label:"Career & Purpose Guidance"},{id:"relationship-reading",label:"Relationship Reading"},{id:"group-session",label:"Group Session / Workshop"},{id:"course-inquiry",label:"Course Enrollment Inquiry"}],validationName:"Name is required",validationNameShort:"Name too short",validationEmail:"Email is required",validationEmailInvalid:"Enter a valid email",validationService:"Please select a service"},gallery:{tagline:"Our Sacred Moments",heading:"Visual",headingItalic:"Gallery",desc:"Glimpses from our sessions, workshops, ceremonies, and the beautiful community of souls on this journey.",categories:["All","Practice","Healing","Workshop","Reading","Ceremony","Spiritual","Courses"],categoryLabels:{All:"All",Practice:"Practice",Healing:"Healing",Workshop:"Workshop",Reading:"Reading",Ceremony:"Ceremony",Spiritual:"Spiritual",Courses:"Courses"},empty:"No images in this category yet. More coming soon!"},testimonials:{tagline:"Real Transformations",heading:"What Souls Are",headingItalic:"Saying",desc:"Thousands of seekers have found clarity, healing, and purpose through our readings and courses. Here are some of their stories.",ratingDesc:"Average rating from",ratingCount:"2,500+ reviews",ratingDesc2:"across all our courses and sessions"},faq:{tagline:"Common Questions",heading:"Frequently Asked",headingItalic:"Questions",desc:"Have questions about Akaashic reading or our services? Find answers below, or reach out to us directly.",categories:["All","General","Sessions","Courses","Booking"],categoryLabels:{All:"All",General:"General",Sessions:"Sessions",Courses:"Courses",Booking:"Booking"},stillHaveQsTitle:"Still Have Questions?",stillHaveQsDesc:"Can't find the answer you're looking for? Our team is happy to help you with any questions.",getInTouch:"Get in Touch",faqsData:[{id:"1",question:"What is Akaashic Reading?",answer:"Akaashic Reading is a sacred practice of accessing the Akashic Records — a cosmic library that contains the energetic imprint of every soul's journey across all lifetimes. Through a specific prayer and channeling process, a trained reader can access information about your soul's purpose, past life experiences, karmic patterns, gifts, and the lessons your soul has chosen to learn in this lifetime.",category:"General"},{id:"2",question:"How do online sessions work?",answer:"All sessions are conducted via video call (Zoom or Google Meet). After booking, you'll receive a confirmation email with the meeting link and a short preparation guide. During the session, you'll be asked to relax and set your intention. The reader will open your records through a sacred prayer, and then you can ask your questions. Sessions are typically 60–90 minutes.",category:"Sessions"},{id:"3",question:"Who can take the courses?",answer:"Our courses are open to anyone who feels called to learn Akaashic reading — no prior experience is necessary for the beginner courses. We welcome spiritual seekers, healers, coaches, therapists, and curious individuals from all walks of life. For Intermediate and Advanced courses, we recommend completing the Foundation Course or having at least 6 months of experience.",category:"Courses"},{id:"4",question:"How do I book a consultancy or reading session?",answer:"Simply fill out our Booking Form in the Consultancy section, or use the 'Book a Consultation' button to get started. Select your desired service, preferred date/time, and include a brief note about what you'd like to explore. You'll receive a confirmation within 24 hours.",category:"Booking"},{id:"5",question:"Are readings done online or offline?",answer:"We primarily offer online readings and sessions via video call, making it accessible to clients worldwide. For clients based in our local area, in-person sessions can be arranged upon special request. Both formats are equally effective, as Akaashic energy transcends physical space and time.",category:"Sessions"},{id:"6",question:"What languages are sessions conducted in?",answer:"Sessions are currently conducted in English and Hindi. We are working to expand to additional regional languages in the near future.",category:"General"},{id:"7",question:"How long does a reading session last?",answer:"A standard personal reading session is 60–90 minutes. Mini readings for specific questions are 30 minutes. Our comprehensive Soul Blueprint readings are 2 hours. All sessions begin on time, so we recommend being ready 5 minutes before your scheduled appointment.",category:"Sessions"},{id:"8",question:"How accurate are the readings?",answer:"Akaashic readings provide spiritual guidance and insights — they are not fortune-telling. The accuracy depends on the clarity of your questions, your openness to receive, and the reader's attunement. Many clients report 80–95% resonance with what is shared.",category:"General"},{id:"9",question:"What should I expect from my first session?",answer:"Your first session begins with a brief introduction and intention setting. You'll be guided into a relaxed state while the reader opens your records. Expect to receive insights about your soul's journey, current life themes, and answers to your questions. We recommend writing down your questions in advance.",category:"Sessions"},{id:"10",question:"Do you offer payment plans for courses?",answer:"Yes! We offer easy payment plans for all courses above ₹5,000. Typically, you can split the payment into 2–3 installments. We also offer occasional scholarships for genuine seekers with financial constraints. Please contact us directly to discuss options.",category:"Courses"}]},contact:{tagline:"We're Here for You",heading:"Get in",headingItalic:"Touch",desc:"Reach out with questions, booking inquiries, or just to say hello. We love connecting with souls on their journey.",contactLabels:["Phone / WhatsApp","Email Address","Instagram","Facebook","Location"],hoursTitle:"Session Hours",hours:[{day:"Monday – Friday",time:"9:00 AM – 8:00 PM IST"},{day:"Saturday",time:"10:00 AM – 6:00 PM IST"},{day:"Sunday",time:"By Appointment Only"}],globalTitle:"Serving Worldwide",globalDesc:"All sessions are conducted online via Zoom or Google Meet. We accommodate all time zones with flexible scheduling.",whatsappCTA:"Chat on WhatsApp",formTitle:"Send Us a Message",formSubtitle:"Fill in the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.",labelName:"Your Name *",labelEmail:"Email Address *",labelSubject:"Subject *",labelMessage:"Message *",placeholderName:"Your full name",placeholderEmail:"your@email.com",placeholderSubject:"What would you like to discuss?",placeholderMessage:"Tell us about yourself and what brings you here...",submitBtn:"Send Message",submitting:"Sending...",successTitle:"Message Sent!",successDesc:"We'll get back to you within 24 hours. Thank you for reaching out! ✨",validationName:"Name is required",validationEmail:"Email is required",validationEmailInvalid:"Enter a valid email",validationSubject:"Subject is required",validationMessage:"Message is required",validationMessageShort:"Please write at least 20 characters"},footer:{taglineSmall:"READING & CONSULTANCY",brandDesc:"Guiding souls toward clarity, healing, and purpose through the timeless wisdom of Akashic reading. Your journey to understanding begins here.",newsletterTitle:"Stay Connected with Sacred Wisdom",newsletterDesc:"Subscribe to receive insights, event invitations, and exclusive spiritual guidance.",emailPlaceholder:"Your email address",subscribeCTA:"Subscribe",quickLinks:"Quick Links",ourCourses:"Our Courses",contactUs:"Contact Us",copyright:"© 2025 Vyana Soul — Reading & Consultancy. All rights reserved.",madeWith:"for every seeking soul",privacy:"Privacy Policy",terms:"Terms of Service"},home:{servicesTagline:"What We Offer",services:[{emoji:"🔮",title:"Personal Readings",desc:"Deep soul-level insights for your life's journey and purpose."},{emoji:"📚",title:"Transformative Courses",desc:"Learn to access the Akashic Records yourself through guided training."},{emoji:"💫",title:"Energy Healing",desc:"Clear karmic imprints and restore your soul's natural alignment."},{emoji:"🌟",title:"Expert Consultancy",desc:"Personalized one-on-one guidance for your most pressing life questions."}],ctaHeading:"Your Soul's Journey Awaits",ctaDesc:"Take the first step toward clarity, healing, and living in alignment with your soul's true purpose.",ctaBtn1:"Book a Reading Now",ctaBtn2:"Explore Courses"}},hi:{nav:{home:"होम",about:"हमारे बारे में",courses:"कोर्स",consultancy:"परामर्श",gallery:"गैलरी",reviews:"समीक्षाएं",faq:"FAQ",contact:"संपर्क",blog:"ब्लॉग",bookNow:"अभी बुक करें",bookSession:"सत्र बुक करें"},hero:{badge:"आत्मा-निर्देशित ज्ञान और परिवर्तन",headline1:"स्पष्टता खोजें",headline2:"व्याण सोल के साथ",subtitle:"प्रमाणित आकाशिक रीडर रेखा बाला के साथ अपनी आत्मा की यात्रा की ब्रह्मांडीय बुद्धि को जागृत करें। परिवर्तनकारी कोर्स, व्यक्तिगत रीडिंग और विशेषज्ञ परामर्श — आपको उपचार, उद्देश्य और गहरी स्पष्टता की ओर ले जाते हैं।",cta1:"कोर्स देखें",cta2:"परामर्श बुक करें",scroll:"नीचे स्क्रॉल करें",stats:[{value:"200+",label:"परिवारों तक पहुँचे"}]},about:{tagline:"हमारी कहानी और मिशन",heading:"हम कौन",headingItalic:"हैं",subheading:"प्राचीन ज्ञान को",subheadingItalic:"आधुनिक साधकों से जोड़ना",p1:"मैं एक प्रतिभाशाली आकाशिक रीडर हूँ जो आत्मा के रिकॉर्ड्स से गहराई से जुड़कर अतीत की अंतर्दृष्टि, वर्तमान में स्पष्टता और भविष्य के लिए मार्गदर्शन प्रस्तुत करती है। अपनी रीडिंग के माध्यम से, मैं व्यक्तियों को उनके जीवन उद्देश्य, संबंधों और आवर्ती पैटर्न को समझने में मदद करती हूँ।",p2:"एक लामा फेरा हीलर के रूप में, मैं प्राचीन बौद्ध परंपराओं में निहित शक्तिशाली, उच्च-आवृत्ति ऊर्जाओं को चैनल करती हूँ। मेरा उपचार कार्य गहरी आध्यात्मिक शुद्धि, नकारात्मक कार्मिक छापों को हटाने और व्यक्तिगत व आध्यात्मिक विकास को गति देने पर केंद्रित है।",p3:"इसके अतिरिक्त, मैं एक कुशल प्राणिक हीलर हूँ जो शरीर के ऊर्जा क्षेत्र के साथ कार्य करती है — बिना शारीरिक स्पर्श के — रुकावटों को दूर करने और संतुलन बहाल करने के लिए। औरा की सफाई और ऊर्जावान करके, मैं तेज़ शारीरिक, भावनात्मक और मानसिक उपचार का समर्थन करती हूँ।",p4:"आकाशिक रीडिंग, लामा फेरा और प्राणिक हीलिंग के एकीकरण के माध्यम से, मैं कल्याण के प्रति एक समग्र दृष्टिकोण प्रदान करती हूँ। मेरा कार्य मन, शरीर और आत्मा को सामंजस्यित करता है। मेरा मिशन व्यक्तियों को आत्म-जागरूकता, आंतरिक शांति और चेतना की उच्च अवस्था की ओर मार्गदर्शन करना है।",tags:["आत्मा-निर्देशित अभ्यास","नैतिक रूप से प्रशिक्षित","विश्व स्तर पर विश्वसनीय","परिणाम-केंद्रित"],certifiedTitle:"रेखा बाला",certifiedSubtitle:"प्रमाणित आकाशिक रीडर",certifiedGuild:"अंतर्राष्ट्रीय आकाशिक गिल्ड",certifiedDesc:"विश्व स्तर पर मान्यता प्राप्त आकाशिक गुरुओं के अधीन वर्षों के समर्पित अभ्यास के साथ प्रशिक्षित।",founderQuote:'"रिकॉर्ड्स में कोई निर्णय नहीं है — केवल आपकी आत्मा के उच्चतम भले के लिए अनंत करुणा और ज्ञान है।"',founderDesc:"वैश्विक स्तर पर हजारों सत्रों के साथ, रेखा बाला गहरे आध्यात्मिक प्रशिक्षण, सहज स्पष्टता और व्यावहारिक मार्गदर्शन का दुर्लभ संयोजन लाती हैं। हर रीडिंग और शिक्षण आत्मा के विकास की सच्ची सेवा से आता है।",founderExtra1:"मैं एक सहज आकाशिक रीडर, लामा फेरा हीलर और प्राणिक हीलर हूँ जो व्यक्तियों को स्पष्टता, संतुलन और आंतरिक परिवर्तन की ओर मार्गदर्शन करने के लिए समर्पित हूँ। मेरा कार्य आत्मा और ऊर्जा शरीर की गहरी परतों को समझने पर केंद्रित है।",founderExtra2:"आकाशिक रीडिंग के माध्यम से, मैं आत्मा के रिकॉर्ड्स तक पहुँचती हूँ ताकि अतीत के प्रभावों, वर्तमान चुनौतियों और भविष्य की संभावनाओं के बारे में अंतर्दृष्टि सामने आ सके। लामा फेरा हीलर के रूप में, मैं गहरी आध्यात्मिक शुद्धि और विकास के लिए उच्च-आवृत्ति ऊर्जाओं को चैनल करती हूँ।",founderExtra3:"इन शक्तिशाली पद्धतियों को एकीकृत करके, मैं एक संतुलित दृष्टिकोण प्रदान करती हूँ जो मन, शरीर और आत्मा का पोषण करता है। मेरा इरादा व्यक्तियों को रुक