y. She helped me in a polite and cooperative manner throughout the session. Her patience and warmth made the entire experience truly comfortable and enlightening.",initials:"MN",color:"from-rose-400 to-pink-600",date:"2024",service:"Personal Consultation"},{id:"3",name:"Mr. Rudra",role:"Client",location:"Mumbai, Maharashtra",rating:5,review:"When my father fell critically ill, a friend suggested I connect with Rekhaji for an Akashic reading. I was skeptical — but desperate. What I experienced was beyond words. Things so accurate, so personal, that I had no explanation. I followed every piece of her guidance with faith. And then something we were all praying for happened… my father survived. Some things cannot be explained — they can only be felt. 🙏",fullReview:"There are some experiences in life that shake you from within and change you forever — this is one of mine. When my father fell seriously ill and was hospitalized, it felt like the ground beneath my feet had disappeared. A friend suggested I connect with Rekhaji for an Akashic reading. Honestly, I didn't believe in any of it — but my heart was desperate. What I experienced next is something I still struggle to put into words. The depth of what she shared, things so accurate and so personal, gave me goosebumps. With nothing to lose and everything at stake, I followed every piece of guidance she gave me — with faith, even if it was borrowed faith in the beginning. And then something we were all praying for happened. My father survived. Even writing this now brings tears to my eyes. This experience has humbled me, opened my heart, and given my family a second chance at life. Some things in life cannot be explained — they can only be felt. 🙏",initials:"MR",color:"from-amber-400 to-orange-500",date:"2024",service:"Healing & Guidance Session"},{id:"4",name:"Ms. Prachi",role:"Student & Spiritual Seeker",location:"Ranchi, Jharkhand",rating:5,review:"I am so grateful I found Rekha Bala during one of the most difficult phases of my life. She not only helped me heal but also gave me simple, practical solutions. Through her guidance I felt a deep connection with my late parrot and grandparents. Whenever I am in dilemma, she reaches out the same day. I feel truly thankful, emotional, and blessed to have found her. 🙏💖",fullReview:"Pranam Mam 🕉️🙏 I am very grateful that I found Rekha Bala during one of the most difficult phases of my life. Being an emotional person, I never thought I would be able to understand myself at such a deep level. She not only helped me heal but also gave me simple and practical solutions for life. Because of her, I felt a connection with my late parrot and my grandparents. She even explained that the white butterfly revolving around my house is my angel. Through her guidance I came to know there is a divine presence around me — and now I can truly feel that warmth and support. The most important thing is that whenever I am in dilemma or tension, she tries to reach out the same day and helps me heal as soon as possible. Her guidance has also given me clarity in my competitive exam journey. It feels like a family member is talking to you and guiding you. I truly feel thankful, emotional, and blessed to have found her. 🙏💖",initials:"MP",color:"from-teal-400 to-cyan-600",date:"2024",service:"Akashic Reading & Healing"}];function Tv({rating:e}){return h.jsx("div",{className:"flex gap-1",children:Array.from({length:5}).map((t,r)=>h.jsx(zo,{className:"w-4 h-4",fill:r<e?"#F59E0B":"none",stroke:r<e?"#F59E0B":"#9CA3AF"},r))})}function Nv({initials:e,color:t}){return h.jsx("div",{className:`w-14 h-14 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-semibold text-lg bg-gradient-to-br ${t} shadow-lg flex-shrink-0`,children:e})}function EP(){const{t:e}=Vr(),[t,r]=E.useState(0),[s,a]=E.useState(1),o=()=>{a(1),r(f=>(f+1)%zi.length)},l=()=>{a(-1),r(f=>(f-1+zi.length)%zi.length)},u=zi[t];return h.jsxs("section",{id:"testimonials",className:"py-24 md:py-32 bg-whit